{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L1-0001", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "A box has 12 pens. Half of them are blue, and half of the blue ones are new. How many new blue pens are there?", "choices": {"A": "3", "B": "6", "C": "12", "D": "2"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "Half of 12 is 6 blue pens; half of 6 is 3 new blue pens.", "tags": ["two-step", "fraction"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L1-0002", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "Ali has 5 apples. He first gets 3 more, then eats 2. How many apples does he have left?", "choices": {"A": "6", "B": "4", "C": "10", "D": "0"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "5 + 3 = 8; 8 − 2 = 6 apples.", "tags": ["two-step", "add-subtract"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L1-0003", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L1", "question": "A bus has 20 passengers. At the first stop, 5 get off and 8 get on. How many passengers are there now?", "choices": {"A": "23", "B": "33", "C": "17", "D": "13"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "20 − 5 = 15; 15 + 8 = 23 passengers.", "tags": ["two-step", "add-subtract"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L2-0004", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "A farm has chickens and sheep. There are 8 animals and 22 legs in total. How many sheep are there?", "choices": {"A": "3", "B": "5", "C": "4", "D": "6"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "If all 8 were chickens, there would be 16 legs. The extra 22 − 16 = 6 legs come from sheep (2 extra each), so 6/2 = 3 sheep.", "tags": ["chicken-sheep", "equation", "multi-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L2-0005", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "Five more than three times a number is 26. What is the number?", "choices": {"A": "7", "B": "9", "C": "6", "D": "8"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "3x + 5 = 26 → 3x = 21 → x = 7.", "tags": ["equation", "two-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L2-0006", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L2", "question": "Ayse's age is twice Beril's age. Their ages sum to 27. How old is Ayse?", "choices": {"A": "18", "B": "9", "C": "12", "D": "15"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "If Beril = B, then Ayse = 2B; B + 2B = 27 → 3B = 27 → B = 9, so Ayse = 18.", "tags": ["age-problem", "equation"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L3-0007", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L3", "question": "A store had 100 kg of flour. On day one, 20% of the total was used; on day two, 25% of the remainder was used. How many kg remain?", "choices": {"A": "60", "B": "55", "C": "40", "D": "65"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "Day one uses 100 × 0.20 = 20 kg, leaving 80 kg. Day two uses 80 × 0.25 = 20 kg, leaving 60 kg.", "tags": ["percentage", "sequential", "multi-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "public"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L3-0008", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L3", "question": "60% of a class are girls, and 50% of the girls wear glasses. If the class has 40 students, how many girls wear glasses?", "choices": {"A": "12", "B": "24", "C": "20", "D": "6"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "Girls = 40 × 0.60 = 24; girls with glasses = 24 × 0.50 = 12.", "tags": ["percentage", "nested-ratio", "multi-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L4-0009", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L4", "question": "A train leaves city A at 09:00 at a constant 60 km/h. City B is 180 km away, and the train takes a 30-minute break on the way. At what time does it reach B?", "choices": {"A": "12:00", "B": "12:30", "C": "13:00", "D": "11:30"}, "answer": "B", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "Driving time is 180 / 60 = 3 hours; with the 30-minute break, total is 3.5 hours. 09:00 + 3:30 = 12:30.", "tags": ["speed-time", "break", "multi-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
{"id": "MIHENK-MULTI-EN-L4-0010", "language": "en", "discipline": "Çok Adımlı Muhakeme", "format": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": "L4", "question": "Apples cost 8 per kg and pears 12 per kg. Ali buys 3 kg of apples and 2 kg of pears and pays with 50. How much change does he get?", "choices": {"A": "2", "B": "4", "C": "6", "D": "8"}, "answer": "A", "answer_short": null, "explanation": "Apples 3 × 8 = 24; pears 2 × 12 = 24; total 48. Change = 50 − 48 = 2.", "tags": ["shopping", "multi-step"], "source": "orijinal-AI-üretim", "version_added": "1.0", "split": "private"}
